Type: Package
Package: vi.stats
Title: Vestigial Information Statistical Methods
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Ed", "Phil", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "ed@phosphene.dev"),
    person("Jan", "Ritch-Frel", role = "aut"),
    person("Flow", "Feel", role = "aut", comment = "AI platform engineer")
  )
Description: Statistical methods for testing Vestigial Information (VI)
    predictions about integration-depth-ordered transcriptomic commitment.
    Provides the Capacity Depletion Index (CDI), gene-category integration
    depth ranking, paired and group statistical tests, sensitivity analyses
    for drug-target and metabolic gene exclusion, and natural-experiment
    responder/non-responder designs. Implements the MPI Handoff Blueprint
    architecture — pure functional interfaces with contract validation.
